# The icon grids are a singleton so every part reads one copy. Everything else
# in this directory is found by the implicit directory lookup.
singleton Glyphs 1.0 Glyphs.qml
# The sound cue table and the one seam a sound is played through (piece F).
# A singleton for the same reason Glyphs is: one copy, read from three files.
singleton Sfx 1.0 Sfx.qml
# PIECE M ROUND 4. The repeat guard, which is a property of the ACTION and not
# of the control: two controls that perform the same destructive thing share one
# guard, and a key handler consults the same one a click does. A singleton
# because there is one child, one pointer and one double-click interval.
singleton Actions 1.0 Actions.qml
